    "role": "Qliphothic Tempter (Gamchicoth — Lesser)",
    "tier": 2,
    "factionId": "",
    "notes": "<p>A manic, capering satyr-thing with feverish pink eyes and a plain wooden chalice that is never empty. It invites onlookers to the dance; those who drink are flooded with euphoric energy and then spend the rest of their short lives craving another sip. The Reveller feeds on the downward spiral, dancing gleefully in the wreckage.</p><p><strong>Qliphah:</strong> Gamchicoth, the Tumults — the Hull of Chesed. Generosity untempered by structure: the gift that consumes the receiver.</p><p><em>Mal's note: 'The first cup is free. So is the fall. Everything between costs.'</em></p>",
